{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zap Colony</strong>\u26a1 is a minimalist, real-time strategy sim where you design and optimize a powered defense grid for a colony on an alien planet. Plan at your own pace with active-pause, reroute on the fly, then scramble when the map zooms out and resources run thin.   <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/5fc85c1b4636927f8b6d617a65951463.poster.avif?t=1773067886\" width=800 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/5fc85c1b4636927f8b6d617a65951463.webm?t=1773067886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/5fc85c1b4636927f8b6d617a65951463.mp4?t=1773067886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAYING ZAP COLONY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place on a grid-based map, with colony buildings and alien hives spawning outside of your control. Your job is to defend the colony from different colored Starclops by strategically placing turrets, upgrading and connecting them to a power source of matching color. Sounds easy? Success is measured by how long you can withstand before the colony is overrun. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/1e99df5f34efa355335f5b90dc0dac93.poster.avif?t=1773067886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/1e99df5f34efa355335f5b90dc0dac93.webm?t=1773067886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/1e99df5f34efa355335f5b90dc0dac93.mp4?t=1773067886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A typical Zap Colony map lasts 20\u201340 minutes. The game unfolds in weeks: each week you choose one of two resource packs, letting you keep building and adapting your defense network as enemy numbers grow and the map expands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/12d4d5b213a4da47587561996a02a4e0.poster.avif?t=1773067886\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/12d4d5b213a4da47587561996a02a4e0.webm?t=1773067886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/12d4d5b213a4da47587561996a02a4e0.mp4?t=1773067886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll manage five resources - <strong>Towers</strong> (zap Starclops), <strong>Power Stations</strong> (built on craters to extract colored power), <strong>Cables</strong> (link Towers to Power Stations), <strong>Splitters</strong> (divide a cable\u2019s power), and <strong>Scaffolding</strong> (lets cables cross other cables or span mountains).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1773067886\" width=18 height=16 /></span>\u00a0<strong>Real-time</strong> growing colony <strong>simulation</strong> with time controls and <strong>active pause</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1773067886\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Build power-lines at your own pace and rearrange resources on the fly  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1773067886\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Place and upgrade defense towers to zap more starclops with a single shot  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1773067886\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Upgrade power stations to charge your towers faster  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1773067886\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Strategically choose rewards each week to replenish your resources  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1773067886\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Unlock all <strong>maps</strong>, <strong>modifiers</strong>, <strong>achievements</strong> and conquer the galactic <strong>leaderboards</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1773067886\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Enjoy the <strong>Sandbox</strong> and <strong>Custom</strong> game modes  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1773067886\" width=18 height=16 /></span> High resolution and widescreen support<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/6cd1b26c7b4bebac9c96b75212b6f3c0.webp?t=1773067886\" width=18 height=16 /></span> Palette settings for color vision impairment</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY THE DEMO AND WISHLIST ZAP COLONY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to <strong>play the free demo</strong>,\u00a0<strong>wishlist </strong>and<strong> follow Zap Colony\u26a1</strong> to get a notification from Steam when the game is released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/a41a8caca5f02615c5c828f0126ea003.poster.avif?t=1773067886\" width=780 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/a41a8caca5f02615c5c828f0126ea003.webm?t=1773067886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/a41a8caca5f02615c5c828f0126ea003.mp4?t=1773067886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3440510?t=1773067886","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3440510?t=1773067886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/dd43e6a953def6f204aae74bfc248ac9de1baffb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773067886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/dd43e6a953def6f204aae74bfc248ac9de1baffb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773067886","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed In